<title>UK: Norway's Ekofisk crude to load 36 cargoes in June.</title>
<headline>Norway's Ekofisk crude to load 36 cargoes in June.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Ekofisk crude oil pipeline system is to load 36 cargoes in June, up two from May, trade sources said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The June programme will consist of nine cargoes of 600,000 barrels, one cargo of 570,000 barrels and 26 cargoes of 500,000 barrels.</p>
<p>A total of 18.97 million barrels are due to load in June, compared with 18.35 million in May.</p>
<p>The first cargo is scheduled to load on June 4.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
